### 📄 2. `Class.drawio` (مخطط الفئات)

```markdown
# مخطط الفئات (Class Diagram) - NQP

## 1. الهدف
يوضح هذا المخطط الفئات (النماذج - Models) الرئيسية في نظام NQP والعلاقات بينها. يعتمد على نماذج Django المستخدمة في تطبيق Backend.

## 2. مخطط Mermaid

```mermaid
classDiagram
    %% ====== نماذج الحوكمة ======
    class User {
        +UUID id
        +String email
        +String phone
        +String full_name
        +String hashed_password
        +String national_id
        +UUID port_id
        +String role
        +Boolean is_active
        +DateTime created_at
        +DateTime updated_at
        +login()
        +logout()
        +change_password()
    }

    class Role {
        +UUID id
        +String name
        +String description
    }

    class Permission {
        +UUID id
        +String name
        +String resource
        +String action
    }

    class AuditLog {
        +UUID id
        +UUID user_id
        +String action_type
        +String resource_type
        +String resource_id
        +JSON old_value
        +JSON new_value
        +String ip_address
        +String user_agent
        +DateTime timestamp
    }

    User "1" -- "0..*" AuditLog : creates
    User "1" -- "0..*" Role : has
    Role "1" -- "0..*" Permission : has

    %% ====== البيانات الأساسية ======
    class Country {
        +UUID id
        +String code_alpha_2
        +String code_alpha_3
        +String name_ar
        +String name_en
        +String risk_level
        +DateTime updated_at
    }

    class Port {
        +UUID id
        +String code
        +String name_ar
        +String name_en
        +String type
        +UUID country_id
        +JSON location_geo
        +Boolean is_active
    }

    class Disease {
        +UUID id
        +String icd_11_code
        +String name_ar
        +String name_en
        +JSON symptoms
        +Int incubation_period_min
        +Int incubation_period_max
        +JSON treatment_protocol
        +Boolean is_public_health_emergency
        +DateTime updated_at
    }

    class Medication {
        +UUID id
        +String name
        +String generic_name
        +JSON interactions
        +String unit
    }

    Country "1" -- "0..*" Port : has
    Country "1" -- "0..*" Traveler : nationality

    %% ====== المسافرين والرحلات ======
    class Traveler {
        +UUID id
        +String passport_number
        +String first_name
        +String last_name
        +Date date_of_birth
        +UUID nationality_id
        +String phone
        +String email
        +JSON medical_history
        +DateTime created_at
        +DateTime updated_at
    }

    class Carrier {
        +UUID id
        +String name
        +String iata_code
        +JSON contact_info
    }

    class Flight {
        +UUID id
        +String flight_number
        +UUID carrier_id
        +String origin_code
        +UUID origin_country_id
        +UUID destination_port_id
        +DateTime scheduled_arrival
        +String status
    }

    class PassengerManifest {
        +UUID id
        +UUID flight_id
        +UUID traveler_id
        +String seat_number
        +DateTime submitted_at
    }

    Carrier "1" -- "0..*" Flight : operates
    Flight "1" -- "0..*" PassengerManifest : has
    Traveler "1" -- "0..*" PassengerManifest : listed_on

    %% ====== الفحص والتقييم ======
    class HealthScreening {
        +UUID id
        +UUID traveler_id
        +UUID port_id
        +UUID officer_id
        +Float body_temperature
        +Int oxygen_saturation
        +Int systolic_bp
        +Int diastolic_bp
        +JSON observed_symptoms
        +DateTime screened_at
    }

    class RiskAssessment {
        +UUID id
        +UUID screening_id
        +String risk_level
        +Float risk_score
        +JSON decision_factors
        +String recommendation
        +DateTime assessed_at
    }

    Traveler "1" -- "0..*" HealthScreening : undergoes
    Port "1" -- "0..*" HealthScreening : performed_at
    User "1" -- "0..*" HealthScreening : performed_by
    HealthScreening "1" -- "0..1" RiskAssessment : has

    %% ====== العيادات والمختبرات ======
    class ClinicVisit {
        +UUID id
        +UUID traveler_id
        +UUID referral_id
        +UUID doctor_id
        +String diagnosis
        +String visit_status
        +DateTime visited_at
    }

    class EMRRecord {
        +UUID id
        +UUID visit_id
        +JSON clinical_notes
        +JSON vital_signs
        +JSON physical_exam
        +DateTime created_at
    }

    class Prescription {
        +UUID id
        +UUID visit_id
        +UUID medication_id
        +String dosage
        +String frequency
        +Int duration_days
        +Text instructions
        +DateTime prescribed_at
    }

    class LabSample {
        +UUID id
        +UUID visit_id
        +String sample_barcode
        +String sample_type
        +UUID collector_id
        +DateTime collected_at
        +String status
    }

    class LabResult {
        +UUID id
        +UUID sample_id
        +UUID disease_id
        +String result
        +Float value
        +UUID entered_by_id
        +UUID approved_by_id
        +String approval_status
        +DateTime result_date
    }

    Traveler "1" -- "0..*" ClinicVisit : has
    ClinicVisit "1" -- "0..1" EMRRecord : has
    ClinicVisit "1" -- "0..*" Prescription : has
    ClinicVisit "1" -- "0..*" LabSample : requests
    LabSample "1" -- "0..1" LabResult : produces
    Disease "1" -- "0..*" LabResult : tested_for

    %% ====== المتابعة المنزلية ======
    class FollowUpPatient {
        +UUID id
        +UUID traveler_id
        +UUID clinic_visit_id
        +Date enrollment_date
        +Date expected_end_date
        +String status
    }

    class DailyHealthLog {
        +UUID id
        +UUID follow_up_id
        +Float temperature
        +Int oxygen_saturation
        +JSON symptoms
        +Int mood_score
        +DateTime logged_date
    }

    class RecoveryCertificate {
        +UUID id
        +UUID follow_up_id
        +UUID approved_by_id
        +String certificate_hash
        +JSON qr_data
        +Date issue_date
        +Date expiry_date
        +String status
    }

    Traveler "1" -- "0..*" FollowUpPatient : has
    FollowUpPatient "1" -- "0..*" DailyHealthLog : has
    FollowUpPatient "1" -- "0..1" RecoveryCertificate : has

    %% ====== العلاقات العامة ======
    User "1" -- "0..*" ClinicVisit : doctor
    User "1" -- "0..*" LabSample : collector
    User "1" -- "0..*" LabResult : entered_by
    User "1" -- "0..*" LabResult : approved_by

    3. شرح العلاقات
العلاقة	الوصف
User → Role	كل مستخدم له دور واحد (Many-to-One).
Role → Permission	كل دور له صلاحيات متعددة (Many-to-Many).
Traveler → HealthScreening	كل مسافر يمكن أن يكون له عدة فحوصات (One-to-Many).
HealthScreening → RiskAssessment	كل فحص له تقييم مخاطر واحد (One-to-One).
ClinicVisit → EMRRecord	كل زيارة لها سجل طبي واحد (One-to-One).
ClinicVisit → LabSample	كل زيارة يمكن أن تطلب عدة عينات (One-to-Many).
LabSample → LabResult	كل عينة لها نتيجة واحدة (One-to-One).
FollowUpPatient → DailyHealthLog	كل مريض متابعة له عدة سجلات يومية (One-to-Many).